  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-12T14:05:25.917826Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-12T15:25:34.652505Z",
  "totalBlocks": 170,
  "translatedBlocks": 140,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf588f3cd7284fca",
      "translationZh": "Microsoft ThinkingBox 根据 AI 智能体留下的记录，而不是生成的句子来评分，然后考察它们能否连续二十次做到。现在，它已通过 Hugging Face 开放使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f537963c6af1d984",
      "translationZh": "图 1：ThinkingBox 让智能体在隔离的 MCP 工具会话中运行，然后对它留下的后端最终状态和副作用进行评分。图片来自我们的 ThinkingBox 论文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c5948e3c8ff5161",
      "translationZh": "这是一篇由 Microsoft 和 Hugging Face 联合撰写的博客，特别感谢 Tommy Guy（Enderis AI 创始人，曾任职于 Microsoft）、Hugging Face 的 Sergio Paniego，以及我们曾经的实习生 Zhuochun Li（匹兹堡大学）、Ali Keramati（加州大学尔湾分校）、Youngmin Ko（西北大学）参与共同撰写和审阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b8dc2c1572adc87",
      "translationZh": "一位顾客写信求助。她购买的价值 $745 的厨房电器因快递“异常”滞留在纳什维尔的一处配送中心，距离预计送达日期已经过去十五天。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6e224f43f4b71fb",
      "translationZh": "AI 智能体做得很仔细。它进行了九次工具调用：调取订单、检查物流追踪信息、查看她的客户档案、两次搜索退款政策、确认没有现有工单、创建工单、记录时间线，并正确理解了政策；她所属的账户类别确实不符合延迟送达补偿的条件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5386e79fbd3dcca6",
      "translationZh": "然后，它将工单标记为已解决并关闭，回复道：“既然您的问题已经解决，还有什么我可以帮您的吗？”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4579d30418ca9f59",
      "translationZh": "有两处不对。承运商的异常仍未解除，因此所要求的最终状态应为暂挂，等待解决。而且，顾客从未就她实际提出的问题得到真正的答复。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6342cb6f5a1f71d5",
      "translationZh": "检查工具调用的 AI 评分器会看到九次格式规范的调用。检查智能体是否写入数据库的评分器也会看到它确实这样做了。可数据库里的实际情况并不认同这个结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d89f6aca8160e3bc",
      "translationZh": "ThinkingBox 衡量的正是这一差距。它涵盖 507 个有状态的业务工作流，每个工作流都针对各种 LLM 模型运行 20 次，并根据后端最终状态和副作用为智能体评分。本文介绍我们的发现、一致性所需的代价，以及如何通过 OpenEnv 自行运行该基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1ab5eb75e49a9d9",
      "translationZh": "你可以自己运行这个案例：上面的示例改编自基准测试任务 sandbox_external_retail_group1.py:test_case_ST003_006，而未能通过的可执行检查只涉及一个字段：工单的 status 为 solved，而要求的最终状态是 hold。完整轨迹见我们论文的附录 D.4，案例 3。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "437aea62a5bd6ad4",
      "translationZh": "目录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ff928a816493faa8",
      "translationZh": "工具调用不等于结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "17f12dc22f0d2e08",
      "translationZh": "一次成功不等于可靠性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7396801ec64aea55",
      "translationZh": "你能信赖智能体背后的模型吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8263415cb7a3952a",
      "translationZh": "一致性所需的代价",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "238d1b094de8ee86",
      "translationZh": "失败特征",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9c870aa6e5e93270",
      "translationZh": "工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b3ab2275bdfe2bb7",
      "translationZh": "自己运行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1da793c29f4b7b75",
      "translationZh": "下一步走向",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69c576132361ae8e",
      "translationZh": "想在阅读结果之前先试一试？请跳到“自己运行”一节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ff928a816493faa8",
      "translationZh": "工具调用不等于实际结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90f455f126d81462",
      "translationZh": "最终回复和有效的工具调用都只是代理指标。智能体听起来可能是正确的，却留下了错误的值、修改了错误的记录，或造成了额外的副作用。只有它留下的记录才能给出定论。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a02eab29a51aaf96",
      "translationZh": "这一差距相当大。在一项基于共同测试集的消融实验中，涵盖了 12 个 LLM 模型的 121,680 次有效试验，其中 79,853 次尝试未通过可执行检查。在这些失败尝试中，67.24% 仍然正常终止、调用了会改变状态的工具，并且没有报告最终工具错误。然而，可执行检查发现，其中 77.61% 存在错误的字段值，43.30% 产生了非预期的额外影响，25.36% 缺少必需的影响。这些状态检查发现的问题存在重叠。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1018ded813a207f3",
      "translationZh": "执行轨迹是一种主张。数据库状态才是证据。重复执行是信任检验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "17f12dc22f0d2e08",
      "translationZh": "一次成功不代表可靠",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8cc1939a72a38720",
      "translationZh": "一个智能体如果只正确处理了一次退款，而接下来的四次都处理失当，就不能算是可用的退款智能体。因此，每项任务都独立运行 20 次，每次都从完全相同的干净后端状态开始，我们报告三个不同的指标：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62448dc3a377ac72",
      "translationZh": "表 1：我们报告的三个数值，以及各自回答的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d275a74912cca2e",
      "translationZh": "指标",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c276e5b78d334d75",
      "translationZh": "衡量什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb3eb360851a18d1",
      "translationZh": "回答什么问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c16a979932ec60b8",
      "translationZh": "所有尝试中成功的比例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6c850ed7b63edff",
      "translationZh": "它通常表现如何？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc4a558a50593c69",
      "translationZh": "在 20 次尝试中至少成功解决一次的任务占比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ef0c33dea2f13f5",
      "translationZh": "它能否在某次尝试中做到？衡量能力覆盖面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ae54f1eacf6d3c8",
      "translationZh": "实测 20/20",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00bb267fa9a98035",
      "translationZh": "在全部 20 次记录的尝试中均实际通过的任务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36904fd52ef71383",
      "translationZh": "它能否始终正确？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40e8fd2d1ac5ac9d",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博文中，我们使用实测 20/20 来表示 507 个任务中在全部 20 次尝试中均通过的任务的实际数量。不使用估计量，也不做平滑处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c41e9c4e320df88d",
      "translationZh": "先从大家熟悉的视角看起。下表按领域列出了 pass@1，即单次尝试得分的估计值。这是大多数排行榜公布的指标，单看这一指标，它就像一份普通的能力排名。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5fd2e63eb2edf882",
      "translationZh": "表 2：ThinkingBox-Bench 各领域的 pass@1（%）。每个模型都在每项任务上接受 20 次重复试验评估。粗体表示组内第一名；下划线表示第二名。单次尝试得分估计值的标准误见我们的 ThinkingBox 论文中的表 4。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6da9d905a1b755b4",
      "translationZh": "零售 (98)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48ddd599e0117d03",
      "translationZh": "汽车保险 (100)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54d1b4799efde522",
      "translationZh": "旅游 (104)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28f01267e7a687a5",
      "translationZh": "新型数字银行 (104)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9b4091fc3c72cfb",
      "translationZh": "咨询 (101)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32b77c75bc7005e1",
      "translationZh": "总体，按任务加权 (507)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f927f38702d23e67",
      "translationZh": "专有模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bedd0151b6aeb878",
      "translationZh": "开放权重模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0178",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c7516c690c7ebc6",
      "translationZh": "Claude Opus 5.5 以 67.16% 的总分领先，比 Claude Opus 5 高三分之二个百分点。Kimi-K3 是最强的开放权重模型，与 GPT-6-Astra 的差距不到一个百分点。领域同样重要：Claude Opus 4.6 在零售领域的得分为 68.62%，但在汽车保险领域仅为 8.30%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0179",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17763ea7a4e332e3",
      "translationZh": "一次出色的运行结果能告诉你，模型可以完成这项工作。但这并不能告诉你，它是否还能再次做到。因此，将每项任务运行 20 次，看看原来的分数还能保留多少。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0180",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b68bd65c1dc7ffd7",
      "translationZh": "图 2：重复运行 20 次后，各模型的单次尝试得分还能保留多少。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0181",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "188bc34313e648c4",
      "translationZh": "只有三个模型保住了其 pass@1 分数的大部分：GPT-6 Astra 保留了其单次尝试成功率的 78%，Claude Opus 5.5 和 Claude Opus 5 则各保留了 71%。在另一端，GLM-5.1、Kimi-K2.6 和 DeepSeek-V4-Pro 各自仅保留了约 8%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0182",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "389e07b16fee5a2f",
      "translationZh": "模型偶尔能做到什么，与它每次都能做到什么，两者之间的差距就是问题的全部。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0183",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7396801ec64aea55",
      "translationZh": "你能依靠支撑你的智能体的模型吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0184",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59778aac4ac923a2",
      "translationZh": "图 3：覆盖广度与一致性出现分化。图中展示了十八个模型中的十二个；为便于阅读，省略了六个 pass@1 低于 33% 的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0185",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f29c403c2e0ce167",
      "translationZh": "在我们测试的所有模型中，Kimi-K3 的覆盖范围最广。它至少成功解决过基准测试中 93.89% 的任务：507 项任务中的 476 项。只有 31 项任务让它始终无法完成，这一数量是所有参测模型中最低的。在零售工作流上，它以 82.24% 的 pass@1 独占鳌头，领先于所有专有模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0186",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7be3e40fd759336",
      "translationZh": "Kimi-K3 同时也是一致性最差的模型之一。在 507 项任务中，只有 68 项在全部 20 次尝试中均成功，占 13.41%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0187",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6020841df173d81b",
      "translationZh": "Claude Opus 5 的情况则恰好相反。它至少成功解决过的任务更少（79.09%；有 106 项任务始终无法完成），但对于基准测试中 47.53% 的任务，它每一次尝试都能完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0188",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a116d71feb2fd88",
      "translationZh": "更新的模型也未能解决这个问题。Claude Opus 5.5 在所有尝试的平均得分上高于 Claude Opus 5，分别为 67.16% 和 66.50%，而且至少成功解决过的任务也更多。但在全部 20 次尝试中均通过的任务数，两者完全相同：241 项。作为主要指标的准确率提高了半个百分点，却丝毫没有换来可靠性的提升。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0189",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4e49bb5c879b1f8",
      "translationZh": "Kimi-K3 至少成功解决过一次的任务比 Opus 5 多 75 个。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0190",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "164a73821e11d6e6",
      "translationZh": "Opus 5 能稳定解决的任务比 Kimi-K3 多 173 个。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0191",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea30e2a85fcf88b8",
      "translationZh": "如果你正在为涉及真实记录的工作选择模型，pass@20 就不是应该关注的那一列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0192",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8263415cb7a3952a",
      "translationZh": "稳定性需要付出什么成本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0193",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88c4807587ecb378",
      "translationZh": "能力比较通常止步于分数。对于任何要部署模型的人来说，相关的问题是：成功完成一个工作单元需要多少成本。我们用每次成功完成任务尝试的成本来衡量这一点。之所以说“任务尝试”，是因为每个基准测试任务都会重复运行，而每次尝试都会产生成本，因此 pass@1 才是与之匹配的质量分母。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0194",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "087bf768b2e88997",
      "translationZh": "我们取每个模型在完整的 507 × 20 轮测试中记录的 token 用量，按 OpenRouter+ 上可用的、未打折的标准标价计算费用，还原促销折扣，并排除声明采用量化的端点。每个模型的输入、输出和缓存费率都来自同一个提供商端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0195",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4297fb00dc55d2ef",
      "translationZh": "然后，我们将一轮运行的成本除以成功的尝试次数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0196",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f1d14dd47f87b07",
      "translationZh": "每次成功完成任务尝试的成本 = 507 次尝试（每个任务尝试一次）的估算成本 ÷ (507 × pass@1)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0197",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e4d3b26f09996ed",
      "translationZh": "这是一个用于比较效率的指标，不是账单，也不是处理一次生产环境请求的价格。它衡量的也是单次成功的成本，而非一致性的成本。接下来，我们计算一致性的成本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0198",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b09f814674d2526f",
      "translationZh": "例如：GPT-5.4 进行 507 次尝试（每项任务尝试一次）的成本为 $43.49，pass@1 为 65.36%，因此 $43.49 ÷ (507 × 0.6536) = $0.131，即每次成功完成任务的尝试成本为 $0.131。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0199",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "aa111e2b3f2f4e85",
      "translationZh": "帕累托成本前沿",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0200",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d3789625ddc27af",
      "translationZh": "如果没有其他模型同时做到成本不高于某个模型、准确率不低于该模型，那么该模型就位于前沿上。有三个模型符合条件；其余每个模型都在至少一个维度上处于劣势。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0201",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f65a0652fd4dea6",
      "translationZh": "图 4：每次成功完成任务的尝试成本与 pass@1 的关系。带圈的圆点表示位于帕累托成本前沿上的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0202",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e247ebcff51e9726",
      "translationZh": "这条前沿有三个阶梯。GPT-5.6 Sol 的每次成功成本最低，为 $0.127；GPT-5.4 的每次成功成本增加 $0.004，pass@1 提高了 3.45 个百分点；Claude Opus 5.5 又提高了 1.80 个百分点，每次成功成本为 $0.276。这三个模型都仍位于成本前沿线上，因为没有更便宜的模型能达到各自的 pass@1。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0203",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9b394fe1ec05b6a",
      "translationZh": "Claude Opus 5 是最明显的例子：每次成功尝试的成本为 $0.475，pass@1 为 66.50%，而 Claude Opus 5.5 的相应数值为 $0.276 和 67.16%，因此前者既更贵，准确率又更低。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0204",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "178cf433283ae493",
      "translationZh": "现在计算一致性的成本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0205",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ea7e6ab43956fd4",
      "translationZh": "每次成功的成本这一指标有利于成本低且经常答对的模型，却不会奖励每次都答对的模型。因此，我们还计算每项可靠任务的成本：将完整的 20 轮测试的成本除以模型在全部 20 次尝试中均通过的任务数量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0206",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d30c6806cf94d8bf",
      "translationZh": "每项可靠任务的成本 = 20 轮、每轮 507 次尝试的估算成本 ÷ 20/20 次均通过的任务数量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0207",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "778226d78d84f981",
      "translationZh": "例如：GPT-6-Astra 的整套测试成本为 20 × $86.03 = $1,720.60，并且有 231 项任务在每次尝试中均通过，因此每项可靠任务的成本为 $1,720.60 ÷ 231 = $7.45。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0208",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88a0922e2ee050b8",
      "translationZh": "表 3：在至少观察到一项任务达到 20/20 次均通过的模型中，每项可靠任务成本最低的九个模型，按成本从低到高排序。金额为估算美元费用，而非实际云服务账单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0209",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0210",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ae90ea0da4c8abf",
      "translationZh": "20/20 次均通过的任务数量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0211",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da737c0640c1b0a2",
      "translationZh": "20 轮的估算成本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0212",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1bcf51f431684023",
      "translationZh": "每项可靠任务的成本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0249",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cdd53391875c56a",
      "translationZh": "现在按一致性排名。GPT-5.4 最便宜，费用为 $6.80，但只有 128 个任务达标。GPT-6 Astra 以 $7.45 达到 231 个，而 Claude Opus 5.5 以 $7.80 达到并列最高的 241 个。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0250",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9358fe77991cf2df",
      "translationZh": "这三者中没有任何一个全面优于其他两个：每多一个能够可靠完成的任务，成本就会更高。Claude Opus 5 也有 241 个任务达标，但费用为 $13.30，因此 Opus 5.5 全面优于它。GPT-5.6 Sol 的单次成功成本最低，为 $0.127，但每个能够可靠完成的任务的成本为 $9.76。获得正确答案最便宜的方式，并不是获得可靠答案最便宜的方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0251",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "238d1b094de8ee86",
      "translationZh": "失败特征",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0252",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84f0c28c8e2a9ffd",
      "translationZh": "我们为每条失败的执行轨迹分配一个确定性的诊断特征，而核心结论具有可操作性：大约每五次失败中有四次源于工具处理，而非推理。我们论文表 5 中的消融研究结果如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0253",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "729219a4d01043ff",
      "translationZh": "失败特征",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0254",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b64e10c58a1a9cc4",
      "translationZh": "占失败的比例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0255",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6da9b01426bfd0f4",
      "translationZh": "工具使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0257",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "687c9f089ed79230",
      "translationZh": "错误的状态更新",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0259",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "010460a384f47d5b",
      "translationZh": "用户问题未完全解决",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0261",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "baabdfd122ac7257",
      "translationZh": "没有执行改变状态的操作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0263",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e72b0d75068eb1a5",
      "translationZh": "这些是各模型占比的未加权平均值，以及可观察到的标签，并非唯一的因果解释。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0264",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f61c4859466b60d",
      "translationZh": "实际呈现的模式很简单：智能体通常能推进到尝试执行工作流的阶段，随后却无法从工具错误、前置条件不满足或查询结果为空的情况中恢复。这首先是重试和错误恢复的问题，然后才是模型的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0265",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3066e8c644731186",
      "translationZh": "难度也因领域而异：在上文表 2 列出的模型中，零售领域的平均 pass@1 为 59.52%，而汽车保险领域的平均值为 33.83%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0266",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bab9cdac0cbc528a",
      "translationZh": "该如何应对。把 20/20 的比率视为设计输入，而不是定论。基准测试评分所依据的同一信号，在生产环境中也可以获取：在提交之前，检查最终状态，而不是模型对该状态的总结。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0267",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3d31707d17058c9",
      "translationZh": "对工具错误和系统错误进行分类，让重试针对那些可恢复的错误。将工具的可用范围缩减到工作流所需的范围。对于无法以低成本撤销的变更，则要求人工批准。我们尚未在这个基准测试上衡量这些措施带来的任何提升，而这恰恰是该环境如今使之可以测试的事情。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0268",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c870aa6e5e93270",
      "translationZh": "工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0269",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de1d7bc5d910ca64",
      "translationZh": "ThinkingBox 是智能体沙箱，而 ThinkingBox-Bench 是用于评估智能体的数据集基准。本文顶部的示意图展示了整个循环；下面介绍各部分的作用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0270",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9eeedb2cecbd6c60",
      "translationZh": "图 5：上方图 1 中面板 A 所示的沙箱循环：隔离的工具会话、最终数据库状态、副作用、可执行评判器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0271",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1b7f33f8933791f",
      "translationZh": "每项任务都定义了初始后端状态、用户目标、可用的 MCP 工具、领域策略，以及针对最终状态的可执行检查。模拟用户持有私有上下文（如预订编号、偏好或出生日期），只有在被询问时才会提供。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0272",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55581eff6b0a2672",
      "translationZh": "每次尝试都会获得一个隔离的 MCP 会话，其状态均重新初始化。同一任务的两次尝试绝不会共享数据库行或缓存的工具状态，这正是让 20 次试验的比较具有意义的原因。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0273",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ab1eff88fbced23",
      "translationZh": "结束时，副作用提取器会推导出实际发生了哪些变化，确定性评判器则将这些变化与要求的最终状态进行比较，接受任何产生正确结果的执行轨迹，同时拒绝错误、缺失或多余的影响。对于无法用明确的数据库值表示的要求（“智能体是否说明了这一点并无保证？”），则通过一个范围明确的二元评分标准问题来处理其语义。507 项任务中，有 477 项仅根据状态评分；另有 30 项加入了回复评分标准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0274",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a795d20b97548216",
      "translationZh": "信任边界：模型可以看到任务、对话和工具模式。标准答案状态、断言、评分内部机制和凭据都保留在评估器一侧。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0275",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b3ab2275bdfe2bb7",
      "translationZh": "自己运行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0276",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32d406590b9eab88",
      "translationZh": "ThinkingBox 现已在 Hugging Face 上发布，包括测试框架和数据集。ThinkingBox-Bench 现已接入 OpenEnv 接口，每个完成的回合都会返回一个表示通过或失败的二元奖励。已发布的适配器专为评估而设计；独立于基准测试的场景可以在训练工作流中使用同一接口。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0277",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "74e492d5d0df0bab",
      "translationZh": "开始之前",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0278",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "acc97fa3856a3aa4",
      "translationZh": "已在 Linux 和 WSL 上使用 Python 3.11+、uv 和 Docker 进行测试。你还需要一份检出到指定发布版本的 thinkingbox-data，以及供智能体、模拟用户和评判器使用的模型端点。一个端点可以同时承担这三种角色，这是最简单的入门方式。OpenEnv 镜像仅启动 OpenEnv API；其余所有组件都需要你自行运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0279",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "569ca49f4aaf7846",
      "translationZh": "安装",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0280",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e64d25e927f358ab",
      "translationZh": "启动 Typesense",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0281",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "716b77f34e1f44ff",
      "translationZh": "在第二个终端中，启动 Typesense 30.1 并等待其健康检查：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0282",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5144f9aad61a27ce",
      "translationZh": "启动 MCP 服务器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0283",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5e5d2184f16b3a7",
      "translationZh": "在第三个终端中，启动 Session Proxy 和 MCP 服务器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0284",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "34e2024bcc837cf8",
      "translationZh": "启动 OpenEnv 服务器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0285",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fb170133d968d03",
      "translationZh": "回到第一个终端，使用指定了你的三个模型的 ThinkingBox YAML 配置启动 OpenEnv 服务器（配置指南）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0286",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1e2cac582fd34fdd",
      "translationZh": "检查就绪状态",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0287",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6359869034e3317d",
      "translationZh": "在运行任何操作之前，先确认就绪状态。在其可观测数据、配置和 Session Proxy 检查通过之前，它会返回 503。它无法观测 Typesense，也无法对每个模型端点进行实时探测，因此请单独确认这些项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0288",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f4610d74607db506",
      "translationZh": "为一个回合评分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0289",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9530ade980b914f",
      "translationZh": "现在为一个真实回合评分。example_usage.py 只执行重置并列出工具；要评估智能体的动作、效果和断言，请使用随包提供的评估器：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0290",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "359f2a7ae5886d6d",
      "translationZh": "OpenEnv 适配器会将运行故障写入一个独立的错误伴随文件，以便重新执行这些失败的尝试，而不是将它们悄无声息地混入模型结果中。规范结果必须解决这些尝试中的问题，或明确说明如何处理这些尝试；我们将系统错误计为未成功的试验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0291",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1697473d70e8881f",
      "translationZh": "运行必须以固定的框架提交、固定的数据发布版本和一个包哈希为前提，因此规范结果是可验证的，而不是仅凭声称。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0292",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1da793c29f4b7b75",
      "translationZh": "下一步往哪里走",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0293",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fece7b32d864b7cb",
      "translationZh": "这项工作有用的部分不是我们的 pass@1 排行榜，而是环境。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0294",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5579d4741ee7c8e2",
      "translationZh": "如果你正在评估一个会接触真实记录的智能体：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0295",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b6a7a105e2cafd0f",
      "translationZh": "检查一次失败。找一次正常终止却仍然失败的运行，看看数据库中实际上发生了哪些变化。这会让你重新理解自己的评估究竟在衡量什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0296",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "90c7dd96bb96832c",
      "translationZh": "使用你自己的模型，通过 OpenEnv 复现一个任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0297",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "31e17c4fc4bbdeba",
      "translationZh": "报告一个重复试验指标，并给出其定义。k 的取值应符合你的用例需求；说明你报告的是 best-of-k 还是 every-of-k，以及你是如何计算它的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0298",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a4769c6f73f819b",
      "translationZh": "更多细节可参见以下链接：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0299",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bfcdfcccdc570889",
      "translationZh": "环境：envs/thinkingbox_env",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0301",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8238a489252b0446",
      "translationZh": "框架：microsoft/thinkingbox · 教程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0302",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "08435f245e2ef361",
      "translationZh": "基准测试：microsoft/thinkingbox-data · v1.0 发布版",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0303",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "98d7d456937bdc9d",
      "translationZh": "数据集查看器：microsoft/ThinkingBox-Bench",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0304",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d8f3c6586ec784a4",
      "translationZh": "论文：arXiv:2608.19741 或 HF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0305",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6af0624ccbb1adfb",
      "translationZh": "强化学习训练（即将推出）：microsoft/thinkingbox-training",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0306",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f3c3fcf10d25f0e",
      "translationZh": "ThinkingBox 代码采用 MIT 许可证；基准测试数据采用 CDLA-Permissive-2.0 许可证；OpenEnv 环境以 OpenEnv 的 BSD-3-Clause 许可证发布。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0307",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "523de16adf4a1f16",
      "translationZh": "免责声明：公开基准测试中的每项任务都是合成重建的。工作流程和政策以真实的企业 AI 智能体应用模式为原型构建；客户并非真实客户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0308",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c4d942e987c10da",
      "translationZh": "ThinkingBox 和 ThinkingBox-Bench 由 Microsoft Copilot Studio 团队与 Toloka 合作构建，参与合作的还有来自匹兹堡大学、西北大学、哥伦比亚大学和加州大学欧文分校、曾在 Microsoft 实习的人员。欢迎在下方评论区或 github 上提问。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0309",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e74e68e97b59667",
      "translationZh": "+ OpenRouter 成本快照采集于 2026 年 9 月 20 日；Opus 5.5 的定价以 Anthropic 网站为准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
